WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.340 --> 00:00:07.060
Last time on The Wokking Dead,

00:00:07.120 --> 00:00:13.720
Chef Brian and I battled it out to see who could make the best Bloody Sundaes.

00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:18.480
Now a random stranger will decide my fate on the show.

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:21.620
BRIAN: And the future of my self-published cookbook.

00:00:22.380 --> 00:00:24.660
BRIAN: Here comes a random stranger walking up now.

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:27.520
CORDON: Whoa! Ozzy Osbourne!

00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:29.500
That really is random!

00:00:29.780 --> 00:00:31.860
Want to try an ice cream sundae?

00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:32.900
OZZY: Sure, why not?

00:00:37.100 --> 00:00:38.700
BRIAN: OK, now try mine.

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:49.220
OZZY: Well, this is no Blizzard of Oz.

00:00:49.880 --> 00:00:52.880
CORDON: OK... So whose did you like better?

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:56.080
OZZY: Oh, easy. I think Chef Brian's is better.

00:00:56.080 --> 00:00:56.580
CORDON: What!?!

00:00:56.580 --> 00:00:59.220
BRIAN: Sorry Cordon, looks like you're off the show.

00:00:59.220 --> 00:01:01.220
No hard feelings, put her there.

00:01:02.020 --> 00:01:03.060
CORDON: AHH!!!

00:01:03.060 --> 00:01:05.020
*screams of agony*

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:07.680
OZZY: Oh my God! HAHAHAHA!

00:01:07.840 --> 00:01:10.640
*screams of agony*

00:01:10.780 --> 00:01:12.760
BRIAN: It's so painful!

00:01:12.940 --> 00:01:14.740
It hurts so much!

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:17.580
BRIAN: Why Cordon? WHY?!

00:01:17.600 --> 00:01:18.880
*screams of agony*

00:01:19.160 --> 00:01:24.820
BRIAN: Put me out of my misery; I can't take this excruciating pain any longer! Why!

00:01:24.880 --> 00:01:26.240
Oh this is horrible.

00:01:26.960 --> 00:01:29.040
CORDON: You're a cool guy Ozzy.

00:01:29.040 --> 00:01:30.160
Sign my boob.

00:01:33.700 --> 00:01:35.240
DAVE: Chef Brian! What happened?

00:01:35.600 --> 00:01:39.440
BRIAN: Cordon challenged me, just like you said he would.

00:01:39.500 --> 00:01:43.820
BRIAN: And I made a Sundae, and Ozzy came up, just like we planned.

00:01:44.240 --> 00:01:48.400
BRIAN: But then Cordon attacked me! Please just stop the pain!

00:01:49.100 --> 00:01:50.060
DAVE: Cordon!

00:01:50.840 --> 00:01:53.600
DAVE: You! There's a zombie outbreak antidote in the fridge. Hurry!

00:01:54.120 --> 00:01:58.040
CORDON: Oh Dave! You won't find any antidote in the fridge!

00:01:58.220 --> 00:02:00.780
I took care of that a long time ago.

00:02:01.340 --> 00:02:03.100
DAVE: Cordon, you really did it this time!

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:05.360
DAVE: But did you really have to drag Chef Brian into this?

00:02:05.360 --> 00:02:06.180
CORDON: Yes.

00:02:10.040 --> 00:02:11.160
BRIAN: Tell my--

00:02:11.400 --> 00:02:14.040
BRIAN: Tell my wife and kids I love them.

00:02:14.220 --> 00:02:15.580
BRIAN: And my dog...

00:02:16.220 --> 00:02:17.340
BRIAN: Blondie.

00:02:17.540 --> 00:02:20.660
CORDON: You won't be telling anyone anything!

00:02:20.660 --> 00:02:21.700
DAVE: What are you talking about?

00:02:21.700 --> 00:02:24.840
CORDON: Remember that fish you had last night with your girlfriend?

00:02:25.660 --> 00:02:30.300
CORDON: That's a little recipe I call Radioactive a la Carte!

00:02:30.700 --> 00:02:35.580
CZsWorld is definitely not responsible if you die from eating that one,

00:02:35.760 --> 00:02:38.900
because I guarantee, YOU WILL! Haha!

00:02:39.200 --> 00:02:44.700
DAVE: You can only push me and push me so far before I snap!

00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:47.320
DAVE: Cordon Gruesome...

00:02:47.320 --> 00:02:49.920
DAVE: Prepare to meet your final course!

00:02:55.540 --> 00:02:59.520
♫ WE ARE THE WOKKING DEAD! ♫

00:03:03.660 --> 00:03:05.760
♫ WE ARE THE WOKKING DEAD! ♫

00:03:05.760 --> 00:03:06.840
♫ THE WOKKING DEAD! ♫

00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:09.760
♫ WE ARE THE WOKKING DEEEAAADDD!!! ♫

00:03:11.380 --> 00:03:15.220
Welcome to the season finale of The Wokking Dead.

00:03:15.720 --> 00:03:19.940
This one comes from a user named Legitimate Lemonade.

00:03:20.260 --> 00:03:21.680
He or she writes:

00:03:26.020 --> 00:03:28.100
Well... stupid Lemonade name,

00:03:28.480 --> 00:03:30.880
it has nothing to do with Dave's hat.

00:03:31.100 --> 00:03:34.780
But I still have a perfect human recipe to demonstrate.

00:03:34.780 --> 00:03:37.700
And it'll be great of all grilling occasions,

00:03:37.780 --> 00:03:41.780
including Zombie Independence Day, Kill All Humans Day...

00:03:41.940 --> 00:03:42.900
and Labor Day.

00:03:44.100 --> 00:03:46.020
For this recipe you'll need:

00:03:46.020 --> 00:03:52.360
salt, pepper, onion powder, garlic powder, dead human, ground coriander and red pepper flakes.

00:03:53.080 --> 00:03:58.680
While we wait for Dave to pass, I'm gonna demonstrate with ground beef, corn and ribs

00:03:58.680 --> 00:04:00.400
in place of the dead human.

00:04:00.400 --> 00:04:03.600
I knew I should have added a pinch of cyanide to his fish...

00:04:04.240 --> 00:04:07.040
Start by adding seasoning to everything.

00:04:07.440 --> 00:04:11.360
For the beef, you'll want to form it into a skull shape.

00:04:11.360 --> 00:04:12.860
Get it in there nice and tight.

00:04:13.120 --> 00:04:16.920
I bought this for $5 online because he looks like me.

00:04:18.460 --> 00:04:21.100
But anyways, you pack the beef in there

00:04:21.100 --> 00:04:24.500
and it makes it taste and feel like a real human brain.

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:30.820
*knocking on door*

00:04:31.140 --> 00:04:32.020
What is that?

00:04:32.020 --> 00:04:35.480
DAVE: Cordon, you open up this school right now or so help me!

00:04:35.480 --> 00:04:37.240
CORDON: Nobody open the door!

00:04:37.680 --> 00:04:38.880
*banging on door*

00:04:39.220 --> 00:04:41.380
DAVE: I will bang this door down!

00:04:41.380 --> 00:04:42.240
*knock knock knock*

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:42.740
*body hits door*

00:04:42.760 --> 00:04:43.480
DAVE: Ahh!

00:04:44.520 --> 00:04:45.880
CORDON: Anyways...

00:04:45.900 --> 00:04:48.220
We need to wrap the corn in tin foil.

00:04:50.920 --> 00:04:52.120
Get in there. Yep.

00:04:52.120 --> 00:04:53.580
Goodnight little buddy.

00:04:53.740 --> 00:04:56.540
Tuck you in. I'll sing you a lullaby later.

00:04:56.540 --> 00:04:58.040
*approaching sirens*

00:04:58.040 --> 00:04:58.800
Ah OK.

00:04:58.800 --> 00:05:01.200
To carry all this stuff, you'll need a tray.

00:05:02.180 --> 00:05:03.460
But I like to use...

00:05:05.060 --> 00:05:05.560
a wok!

00:05:05.900 --> 00:05:09.580
DAVE: You're in for it now, you obnoxious zombie slime!

00:05:09.880 --> 00:05:13.080
CORDON: Whoa Dave! No need to pull the race card.

00:05:13.080 --> 00:05:13.680
*controlled explosion*

00:05:14.780 --> 00:05:17.880
FDA: FDA Motherfuckers, put your Goddamn hands where I can see 'em!

00:05:18.220 --> 00:05:19.020
CORDON: Oh!

00:05:25.740 --> 00:05:27.180
CORDON: What is this?

00:05:27.180 --> 00:05:32.280
FDA: I've got reports of you eating baby brains, radioactive foods and a whole lot of other shit you dead fuck!

00:05:32.540 --> 00:05:34.220
Are you Cordon Gruesome?

00:05:36.160 --> 00:05:37.120
CORDON: No...

00:05:38.080 --> 00:05:39.300
That's Cordon Gruesome!

00:05:40.240 --> 00:05:41.300
DAVE: He's lying, get him!

00:05:41.300 --> 00:05:42.480
FDA: Boys, book him!

00:05:44.100 --> 00:05:44.600
*thud*

00:05:48.580 --> 00:05:49.940
*knock knock knock*

00:06:04.700 --> 00:06:05.740
FDA GENERAL: Freeze Gruesome!

00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:09.420
I got the shot all lined up so don't try anything!

00:06:10.380 --> 00:06:11.380
CHRIS: You ain't got shit!

00:06:13.060 --> 00:06:14.100
CORDON: Chris!

00:06:15.680 --> 00:06:17.280
CORDON: Welcome to the show buddy!

00:06:17.280 --> 00:06:18.020
CHRIS: What up Cordon?

00:06:18.020 --> 00:06:18.920
CORDON: Glad you made it.

00:06:18.920 --> 00:06:20.520
CHRIS: Always and forever man.

00:06:20.520 --> 00:06:26.820
CORDON: Alright Chris. Your job for the next two human hours is to guard this grill with your life.

00:06:27.120 --> 00:06:31.440
Because thats how long this takes to cook these ribs at 375°F.

00:06:31.440 --> 00:06:32.760
CHRIS: Alright, sounds easy.

00:06:36.280 --> 00:06:39.160
DAVE: AHHHHHHHHHHHHHHHH!!!!!!!!!!!!!!

00:06:52.280 --> 00:06:55.640
CORDON: The meat loaf can be cooked for 45 minutes,

00:06:55.820 --> 00:06:59.740
until it hits an internal temperature of 160°F.

00:07:02.500 --> 00:07:04.660
CORDON: And the corn can cook for 20 minutes,

00:07:04.680 --> 00:07:06.760
and you can rotate it slowly...

00:07:06.760 --> 00:07:08.220
if you're not being shot at.

00:07:24.980 --> 00:07:27.460
DAVE: This is for 5 episodes of abuse.

00:07:27.460 --> 00:07:29.580
ZOMBIE BRIAN: Auuuugghhhhhh....

00:07:30.620 --> 00:07:31.980
CORDON: Chef Brian?

00:07:31.980 --> 00:07:33.020
ZOMBIE BRIAN: Braaaiiiinnnssss!

00:07:33.020 --> 00:07:34.320
CHRIS: No, don't eat me, eat him!

00:07:34.320 --> 00:07:35.960
CORDON: They always start off like that.

00:07:40.820 --> 00:07:41.460
FDA: Agh!

00:07:43.700 --> 00:07:48.260
Incidentally, grilling forks are a great tool for impaling humans.

00:07:54.120 --> 00:07:57.780
Well, this brings us to the end of The Wokking Dead.

00:07:58.380 --> 00:08:02.740
We've cooked up 6 of the most delicious recipes known to man.

00:08:03.000 --> 00:08:03.720
Or Zombie.

00:08:04.480 --> 00:08:07.940
And somehow, Dave and I didn't kill each other.

00:08:08.580 --> 00:08:10.500
CORDON AND CHRIS: Oh shit...

00:08:10.500 --> 00:08:12.080
CORDON: Well, anyways.

00:08:12.080 --> 00:08:13.980
I hope you had as much fun as I did.

00:08:13.980 --> 00:08:17.600
Remember, like and subscribe and do this in your own kitchen,

00:08:17.600 --> 00:08:18.780
on your own grill,

00:08:19.160 --> 00:08:20.280
IN YOUR OWN HOME!

00:08:20.280 --> 00:08:21.360
Or wherever you live...

00:08:23.560 --> 00:08:25.000
*massive explosion*

00:08:25.320 --> 00:08:28.120
Your chef, Cordon Gruesome, signing off.

00:08:34.140 --> 00:08:35.840
Coming up on the 10 o'clock news,

00:08:35.840 --> 00:08:39.140
the new phenomenon that all the kids are calling: "roadhead".

00:08:39.780 --> 00:08:45.220
But first, the story of how the FDA opened fire on celebrity chef Cordon Gruesome.

00:08:45.220 --> 00:08:51.020
Sources say that he was filming an episode of his show The Wokking Dead when the incident occured.

00:08:51.980 --> 00:08:53.900
Hundreds are presumed dead.

00:08:54.940 --> 00:08:56.660
Gruesome's whereabouts are still unknown.

